             /********************************************************/
             /*** Storeroom Withdrawal user restrictions           ***/
             /***                                                  ***/
             /*** Used for conversion from MMIS to SAP PM.         ***/
             /***   This job runs on demand when the user takes    ***/
             /***   MMIS menu option PMCC.                         ***/
             /***   It submits a job that reads clock cards to be  ***/
             /***   restricted / unrestricted (Y/N) and modifies   ***/
             /***   that users personnel record in MCFPMM0300      ***/
             /***   by putting Y (or N) in the PERPAD field.       ***/
             /***                                                  ***/
             /***   09/17/2021 D. BARAONA                          ***/
             /***   RFC 1122593, CD 5106272, CPPI 2020-0119673     ***/
             /***                                                  ***/
             /********************************************************/

             PGM

/*  We want to capture the joblog because any clock cards entered that are  */
/*    invalid will be displayed in the joblog.                              */

             SBMJOB CMD(CALL PGM(CLSWCCRST)) JOB(CLSWCCRST) JOBD(MCMGR) +
                    LOG(4 0 *SECLVL) LOGCLPGM(*YES)

             ENDPGM
